    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><verbatim>Metadata handler for standalone PKG-INFO files

Usage::

    metadata = FileMetadata(&quot;/path/to/PKG-INFO&quot;)

This provider rejects all data and metadata requests except for PKG-INFO,
which is treated as existing, and will be the contents of the file at
the provided location.
</verbatim> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
